        "original_id": "999d7f29-67fe-53cb-a568-51f0f1ae1f2f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Mandrake, John Ostrander, Kim Yale, Paul Kupperberg, Cary Bates, Greg Weisman, John K. Snyder III, Rick Hoberg, Rafael Kayanan, Pat Broderick\n- Roles: comics artist, writer\n- Organizations: DC Comics, First Comics\n- Products: Grimjack, Firestorm, The Spectre, Martian Manhunter, Janus Directive\n- Concepts: fictional superhero\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Mandrake was born on May 26, 1956.\n- Tom Mandrake is an American comics artist.\n- Tom Mandrake is best known for collaborations with writer John Ostrander on Grimjack from First Comics and on Firestorm, The Spectre, and Martian Manhunter from DC Comics.\n- Martian Manhunter, also known as J'onn J'onzz, is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics.\n- Janus Directive had contributions from writers John Ostrander, Kim Yale, Paul Kupperberg, Cary Bates, and Greg Weisman.\n- Janus Directive had contributions from artists John K. Snyder III, Rick Hoberg, Rafael Kayanan, Tom Mandrake, and Pat Broderick.",
